## New test file (written from scratch — no existing coverage to extend)
src/components/discover/HiddenByLimitationsFooter.test.tsx — 5 tests: null
breakdown renders nothing, all-zero breakdown renders nothing, a non-zero
past_purchases count shows in the total and its row once expanded, sorts
correctly alongside another non-zero reason, and past_purchases is safely
omitted when absent from the breakdown object entirely.

Mocks: @/lib/i18n-toast (t()) only. Wrapped in a real MemoryRouter (this
repo's established pattern for components rendering react-router-dom's
Link — see ProfileDrawer.test.tsx) rather than mocking Link itself, since
this component's own Link usage is exactly what's under test (the "Adjust"
deep-link per reason row).

